						 <div style="color: black; border: solid 1px #000000; background:#f2f2c2 url(http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/the-great-hippo/scp_trans.png) 20px 20px/20% no-repeat; margin: auto; max-width: 500px; padding:20px; margin-bottom: 10px;"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span>RAISA特别通告</span></h3> <p><strong>以下备忘录需转发给全体负责编写SCP文档的基金会人员。</strong></p> </div> <p>根据O5议会的命令，SCP基金会已开始实行新的收容协议，以提高整个组织编写文档的方法论。因为到目前为止，我们的项目等级结构并未包含文档本身即构成对收容和常态的威胁的情况，确信已有必要扩大我们的项目等级词汇以编入该新的收容协议。</p> <p>所有旨在通过改进文档以协助收容的材料需被分类为项目等级：<strong>播客</strong>。</p> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/object-class-podcast/Logo.png" alt="Logo.png" class="image" /></div> <p>大家好，欢迎来到《项目等级：播客》——一个由<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1841781&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608643459" alt="A Random Day" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1841781)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" >A Random Day</a></span>和<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/captain-kirby" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3440103&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608643459" alt="Captain Kirby" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3440103)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/captain-kirby" >Captain Kirby</a></span>主持的节目，他们相互争论为SCP维基写作的艺术和技巧，包括的话题从创造GOI到逼真性的重要性等无所不有。我们会作为作者分析自己的作品、赞赏别人写得更好的作品，以此尝试提出一些实用的建议。</p> <p>标志由<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aethris" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5158506&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608643459" alt="Aethris" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5158506)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aethris" >Aethris</a></span>绘制，你们可以在<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/aethris-art">这里</a>查看她的艺术作品！</p> <p>新一集会每隔一周在周一发布到以下平台：</p> <p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pK-Rf6zPRhQ&amp;list=PL2EuN0PjqPKkMkWqQtcLgb8_ooG3zOJ3V" target="_blank">Youtube</a><br /> <a href="https://anchor.fm/objectclasspodcast" target="_blank">Anchor</a></p> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <th>集数</th> <th>链接</th> </tr> <tr> <td>项目等级：相关组织</td> <td><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pK-Rf6zPRhQ&amp;list=PL2EuN0PjqPKkMkWqQtcLgb8_ooG3zOJ3V">Youtube</a> <a href="https://anchor.fm/objectclasspodcast/episodes/1-Groups-of-Interest-ej6827">Anchor</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>项目等级：折叠与脚注</td> <td><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v4xBLIyc5DM&amp;list=PL2EuN0PjqPKkMkWqQtcLgb8_ooG3zOJ3V&amp;index=2">Youtube</a> <a href="https://anchor.fm/objectclasspodcast/episodes/2-Collapsibles--Footnotes-ej69u0">Anchor</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>项目等级：吸睛</td> <td><a href="https://youtu.be/A5NbNFmqmrQ">Youtube</a> <a href="https://anchor.fm/objectclasspodcast/episodes/3-Hooks-emtf69">Anchor</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>项目等级：把握SCP节奏</td> <td><a href="https://youtu.be/6ksnGpZbMgU">Youtube</a> <a href="https://anchor.fm/objectclasspodcast/episodes/4-Pacing-Your-SCPs-enfajg">Anchor</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>项目等级：访谈记录</td> <td><a href="https://youtu.be/IdkBXjXs-Os">Youtube</a> <a href="https://anchor.fm/objectclasspodcast/episodes/5-Interview-Logs-eo25tv">Anchor</a></td> </tr> </table> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/esperanza-cai" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4113182&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608643459" alt="Esperanza_Cai" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4113182)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/esperanza-cai" >Esperanza_Cai</a></span></p> 
